                                                "sense_id": "a80ef300-2b0a-3c7c-bc75-6b4ad902c9b1",
                                                "text": "“We have been working on nanomachines over the past decade,” Joseph Wang, chairman of nanoengineering at UCSD, said. “One of the challenges we considered is to deliver therapeutic cargo deep."
